From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Subject: [PATCH] luma: correct captured Studio card and control metrics

Remove inherited account-footer sizing and subtitle padding. Express spacing
with positive native margins; negative margins overflow St unsigned sizing.
The lip rim is inset paint and consumes no text width, as in current Studio.
GPL-2.0-or-later, following GNOME Shell upstream.

